ing for amusement or financial gain;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"889f32bc-8b93-5090-b111-eee7d13a7ded"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"6.05.120","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/6.05.120","content_hash":"7cad2b6310b356e47b7db2c3e4977a72ba97dde6db8ee70719edac063b241fe4","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.05.120:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.05.120:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/6.05.120","text":"(2) Training any animal under circumstances evincing an intent that such animal engage in animal fighting, for amusement or financial gain;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"8934cce2-ad3f-546b-b0a4-52cbe921daa2"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"6.05.120","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/6.05.120","content_hash":"58ed23fee2f80d2a5b2a6efa67f75f00e9605cbea65ee3581144069708b30539","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.05.120:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.05.120:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/6.05.120","text":"(3) Permitting any act described in subsection (b)(1) or (b)(2) of this section to occur on premises under his control;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"66eb9c36-8336-5257-8d66-b3d6013a3d4d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"6.05.120","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/6.05.120","content_hash":"00bc1031c85a0f2e0efc03de9488f5df31756b405d09b920823086324b22ac1b","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.05.120:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.05.120:block:5","source_url":"http